                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Given his accent, I'd say the stranger was from Marleybone. Go there and talk to the first person you see after exiting the Spiral. I'd bet all my leaves that she's talked to them...",
